+2. Use the six default bug-stage mappings below when Claude is unavailable and the Codex CLI passes preflight. Match the entire tuple against the keyed response. These mappings select host class `codex-cli` and provider `openai` under `B077-default-bug-anthropic-codex-v1`; they do not select a model ID. Discover the available model through `config/read` on the selected Codex CLI executable, and record that result as the selected model. This is a limited operational provider substitution authorized by the owner's optional-Claude direction and scoped in the Architect consultation. It makes no model-equivalence claim. Check the installed selector, authentication and readable identity source before claim. For an eligible exact Claude route, pass through the supported literal selector, including `fable` and supported full model names. Consult this table only to select the provider substitute. Substitution for a changed or custom tuple outside the table requires its own documented authority. [Workflow tuples](../../../internal/sharkdata/default_data/workflow/bug.yaml) · [Owner decisions and technical advice](B077.repair-plan-evidence.md#route-authority)
