+## Revision and authority
+
+I hashed the plan from commit `8eca10611f2cbe860dc0e9cb9f2e2068a5843957` and compared it byte-for-byte with the working file. I independently confirmed the declared baseline, **`bbf490c6ec2bd597d6f3e6e4cdd93e68ca54fa50`**, against Shark B078 assignment note 3556, the Git parent of the first repair commit `932dd5080aaa592e24a427ce1a999ee34603f554`, and the base recorded in all four prior reviews. It also equals the merge base with the inspected main. The single seven-row index links to existing headings in a separate mutable record. The initial parent-context lookup returned research 415, plan 443 and evidence 444.
