+**Verdict: replan.** Revision 4 addresses all twelve findings from the first three reviews. Two parent-selection guarantees still lack distinguishing assertions at the registered delete command. In isolated probes, each regression produced a successful confirmation while removing a link the shipped command would have preserved. Both concern the planned changes to parent lookup. The earliest affected stage is repair planning.
