+**Reviewer.** Codex, independent TechLead for the B078 plan-review dispatch, November 19, 2026. The committed plan at `9c99415d3d411dcb694a57f2fab433d168f06e8e` and its working file have the digest above. The declared baseline is **`bbf490c6ec2bd597d6f3e6e4cdd93e68ca54fa50`**. I confirmed it against assignment note 3556, the Git parent of first repair commit `932dd508`, the merge base with upstream, and the bases in the four historical code reviews. The assigned project’s related-document list returned research 415, plan 443, mutable evidence 444, and reviews 445–447. All fifteen index rows have the six required columns and every evidence link resolves to a heading in document 444.
