+| 7 | The four owner associations and stored paths distinguish the target from the shared workaround and the unrelated same-title record. The malformed path has no file to delete. |
+| 8 | Shipped B079 document tests and maintained reference, isolated fixtures and fresh candidate receipts bind the prior findings to the repair. Old green runs and their skips keep their historical scope. |
+| 9 | Each of three one-column siblings exposes one shortened DELETE or existence query. Exact six-column snapshots after removal and direct absent-target retry detect overwritten link metadata. |
+| 10 | Seven distinct handler cases and fourteen process/mode cases observe acquisition cause, exit 2, exact label/key and both streams before service dispatch. |
+| 11 | The six wrappers must return the exact configuration error with configured fail-on-access readers. The direct Question route has its separate sentinel check. |
+| 12 | Each rejected write checks a handler cause and both process modes. Counting the bare unlink phrase and exact parent key finds duplicate or lost context. |
+| 13 | Canonical-first, compact-only, corrupt canonical, corrupt qualified, missing, stale-slug and healthy qualified controls distinguish alias selection from storage failure. F4 applies to other users of the same repository. |
+| 14 | Zero storage attempts, exact type/ID errors and a positive control catch even a discarded connection attempt before validation. |
