+- *Repository error meaning:* class statement: “Change-card and tech-debt command boundaries must preserve true absence separately from storage/read/write failure while naming the failed operation.” Mechanical enumeration found four `mapRepositoryError` call sites in `change.go` and five in `tech_debt.go`; `repository_errors_test.go` now asserts exact keys for all nine callback tests. The compiled process matrix covers all seven registered get/update/delete/triage command variants in JSON and human modes for missing keys and scan failures, and injects failed updates/deletes/triage writes with independent record readback. All surfaces were exercised; no caller was silently skipped.
