+- `internal/services/tech_debt_service.go:494-527`, `internal/cli/services_global.go:545-569`, and `internal/services/entity_document_service.go:19-25,52-165` — existing tech-debt document methods, CLI wiring, and generic persistence contract.
+- `docs/cli-reference/discovery-commands.md:135-230` — maintained add/list/delete contract and examples.
