+- /home/jwwel/.claude/skills/shark-rider/skills/sprint-execution/workflows/run-sprint.md:77-82 — installed user skill; symlink resolves to the shared main checkout. Workflow SHA-256 matches maintained and embedded copies.
+- internal/sharkdata/default_data/prompts/sprint/active.md:3-10 — embedded active-sprint prompt includes the skill and uses keyless sprint next.
+- internal/cli/commands/sprint.go:499-520,2050-2067 — no-positional CLI definition and service caller; go run ./cmd/shark sprint next S010 --json reproduced the unknown-command error.
+- internal/services/sprint_service.go:1724-1744,1770-1819,1840-1888 — keyless cross-execution-sprint selection, returned sprint identity, and explicit-key candidate selection.
+- internal/db/db.go:4685-4696 and internal/db/sprint_tables_migration_test.go:139-160 — multiple active sprints are intentionally allowed.
