+- **Review baseline:** `bbf490c6ec2bd597d6f3e6e4cdd93e68ca54fa50`, tree `0764bb9a04abc4c8001bd1ec9cc88d709bcc2ad5`.
+- **Assigned candidate before this plan revision:** `980a63426efd3c7ad2e087ff5b07c2ccfc4f70e2`.
+- **Production reproduction:** both explicit-workflow and selected-profile paths call `validate_codex_catalogs` without a CLI catalog and fail before adapter dispatch because no trusted same-account source is supplied. The adapter candidate already forwards the requested route model.
+- **Evidence hashes:** updated research report `5aefe0443c79fa20a251a9e4e335acdc1e7ac0d1a7115361b61e10efd68142f0`; materializer observed before revision `0e2673e74b58e1964cce26c30815414dbe9a56c29b27964ddd542b64ebba6f3b`; routing library observed before revision `2ca7a0c5ffcb7f5add6f0fedcc9757190c257b3e0f67aa54a896c211b459fe0a`.
