+The older project-root executable reproduces the report. The installed executable matching the baseline succeeds. The original reporter did not record executable identity. Use a verified build containing the delivered fix for intake. Verify CLI, service and storage behavior on a containing build. The expected development diff adds the resolver factory and focused CLI regression tests. Schema changes, binary replacement and project configuration changes are outside scope. The earlier [recovery plan](../2026-10-15-sprint-integration-recovery-plan.md) assigned this repair to B082. Its configuration and caller-parity requirements still apply. CC-048 and CC-049 used the working entity-first path to record separate sprint issues.
