+- [x] `scope_vocabulary` — Evidence: docs/plan/changes/CC-044.md; internal/sharkdata/default_data/skills/quality/context/caller-path-contracts.md; internal/sharkdata/default_data/skills/quality/workflows/defect-class-sweep.md
